y q;","filename":"pauli-y.qasm","framework":"OpenQASM 3.0","language":"openqasm","status":"native"}],"description":"The Pauli gate that combines a bit flip with a phase rotation around the y axis.","descriptionJa":"ビット反転とY軸周りの位相回転を組み合わせるパウリゲートです。","explanation":"Y = iXZ up to convention. Its square is identity, while the i and -i phases are important when amplitudes interfere.","explanationJa":"Yは規約上iXZとして表せます。二乗は恒等ですが、振幅が干渉するときiと-iの位相が重要です。","explanationMd":"Pauli-$Y$ is $Y=\begin{pmatrix}0&-i\\ i&0\end{pmatrix}$, combining a bit flip with a phase. Directly: $Y|0\rangle = i|1\rangle$ and $Y|1\rangle = -i|0\rangle$, matching this record's basis-action check. Up to convention $Y = iXZ$ (equivalently $-iZX$), which is why it behaves as the "odd one out" when composing $X$ and $Z$. $Y$ is Hermitian and unitary with $Y^2 = I$, so like $X$ and $Z$ it is its own inverse — the identity this record's matrix square verifies. Its eigenstates $|{\pm}i\rangle = \frac{1}{\sqrt2}(|0\rangle \pm i|1\rangle)$ have eigenvalues $\pm1$ and correspond to a $\pi$ rotation of the Bloch sphere about the $y$-axis. The imaginary prefactors are invisible to a single computational-basis measurement but matter as soon as $Y$ acts inside a superposition where relative phase drives interference, e.g. inside $Y$-basis stabilizer measurements.","explanationMdJa":"パウリ$Y$は $Y=\begin{pmatrix}0&-i\\ i&0\end{pmatrix}$ で、ビット反転と位相を組み合わせます。直接計算すると $Y|0\rangle = i|1\rangle$、$Y|1\rangle = -i|0\rangle$ となり、この項目の基底作用チェックと一致します。規約上 $Y=iXZ$($-iZX$と同値)と表せ、$X$と$Z$を合成する際に「特殊な」演算子として現れます。$Y$はエルミートかつユニタリで $Y^2=I$、$X$や$Z$と同様に自分自身の逆演算であり、これがこの項目の行列二乗チェックが確認する内容です。固有状態 $|{\pm}i\rangle = \frac{1}{\sqrt2}(|0\rangle \pm i|1\rangle)$ の固有値は$\pm1$で、ブロッホ球の$y$軸周りの$\pi$回転に対応します。虚数の係数は単一の計算基底測定では見えませんが、重ね合わせの中で相対位相が干渉を左右する場面、例えば$Y$基底でのスタビライザー測定では重要になります。","exportStatus":"Native OpenQASM 3 · direct framework snippets available","framework":"OpenQASM 3.0","introduction":"Pauli-Y rounds out the three Pauli generators and makes phase-sensitive basis changes explicit.","introductionJa":"パウリYは3つのパウリ生成子をそろえ、位相に依存する基底変換を明示します。","literature":[{"authors":"Michael A. Nielsen and Isaac L. Chuang","relevance":"Standard graduate textbook covering the single- and two-qubit gate definitions, matrix identities, and circuit primitives this record states.","relevanceJa":"この項目が示す1・2量子ビットゲートの定義、行列恒等式、回路プリミティブを扱う標準的な大学院教科書です。","title":"Quantum Computation and Quantum Information: 10th Anniversary Edition","url":"https://doi.org/10.1017/cbo9780511976667","year":"2010"}],"metadata":[{"label":"Matrix","value":"[[0, -i], [i, 0]]"},{"label":"Rotation","value":"π around Y"},{"label":"Square","value":"I"}],"provenance":"Curated reference","relatedSlugs":["pauli-x-operator","pauli-z-gate"],"resources":[{"label":"Qubits","value":"1"},{"label":"Depth","value":"1 gate"},{"label":"Outcomes","value":"1 per input"}],"slug":"pauli-y-gate","source":{"kind":"curated_reference","license":"CC BY 4.0-compatible reference metadata","reviewedBy":"Leona Quantum curation pass","title":"OpenQASM 3 standard gate set","url":"https://openqasm.com/language/gates.html"},"sourceCoverage":{"hardware":"unknown","simulation":"unknown","theory":"unknown"},"status":"verified","tags":["pauli","phase","single qubit"],"title":"Pauli-Y gate","titleJa":"パウリYゲート","topics":["operator"],"updatedAt":"2026-07-15","verification":"Exact matrix check · Y² = I","verificationDetails":{"method":"Compare the standard Pauli-Y matrix with the basis-state action and verify its unitary inverse.","result":"Pass · Y maps |0⟩ to i|1⟩ and |1⟩ to -i|0⟩ up to the expected phase."},"verificationMethods":["unitary_equivalence","truth_table","research_paper"],"visualization":{"operations":[{"label":"Y","qubits":[0],"tone":"accent"}],"outcomes":[{"label":"1 from |0⟩","probability":1}],"wires":["q[0]"]}}

