TVD}=0.0088$を閾値$\delta\le0.05$と比べています。これは「サンプリングされた回路が自身の理想シミュレーションと一致する」ことの証拠であり、$p=1$がグラフの真の最大カットを見つけるという主張ではありません。","exportStatus":"OpenQASM 3 available · parameter binding retained","framework":"Qiskit","industryUseCases":["Portfolio and scheduling heuristics","Routing and graph partitioning","Constraint-aware resource allocation"],"industryUseCasesJa":["ポートフォリオとスケジューリングのヒューリスティクス","経路探索とグラフ分割","制約付きリソース配分"],"introduction":"This record moves from primitives to a small optimization workload: the objective, circuit, sampling boundary, and acceptance metric stay visible together.","introductionJa":"目的関数、回路、サンプリング条件、判定基準を一緒に確認できる小規模な最適化例です。","literature":[{"authors":"Edward Farhi, Jeffrey Goldstone, Sam Gutmann","relevance":"Introduces QAOA for approximate combinatorial optimization and analyzes MaxCut at fixed depth.","relevanceJa":"固定深さのMaxCutを含む、組合せ最適化の近似アルゴリズムとしてQAOAを導入します。","title":"A Quantum Approximate Optimization Algorithm","url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/1411.4028","year":"2014"},{"authors":"Wang, Hadfield, Jiang, Rieffel","relevance":"Analyzes parameter setting and the ring-of-disagrees instance used by this record.","relevanceJa":"この項目と同じリング型の問題とパラメータ設定を分析します。","title":"The QAOA for MaxCut: a fermionic view","url":"https://doi.org/10.1103/physreva.97.022304","year":"2018"}],"metadata":[{"label":"Graph","value":"5-node ring"},{"label":"QAOA depth","value":"p = 1"},{"label":"Acceptance","value":"TVD ≤ 0.05"},{"label":"Seed","value":"42"}],"provenance":"Verified run","relatedSlugs":["bell-state-qiskit","qft-resource-screen"],"resources":[{"label":"Qubits","value":"5"},{"label":"Depth","value":"14 gates"},{"label":"Shots","value":"4096"}],"slug":"qaoa-maxcut-ring","source":{"contributor":"LeonaQ public reference set","kind":"curated_reference","license":"CC BY 4.0-compatible reference metadata","reviewedBy":"LeonaQ literature curation pass","title":"A Quantum Approximate Optimization Algorithm","url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/1411.4028"},"sourceCoverage":{"hardware":"unknown","simulation":"unknown","theory":"unknown"},"status":"verified","tags":["optimization","maxcut","qaoa","simulation"],"title":"QAOA MaxCut on a 5-node ring","titleJa":"5ノードリングのQAOA MaxCut","topics":["algorithm-reference","qaoa","optimization"],"updatedAt":"2026-07-12","verification":"Statistical TVD 0.0088 ≤ δ 0.05 · seed 42 · 4096 shots","verificationDetails":{"method":"Sampled distribution compared with the reference simulator using total variation distance.","result":"Pass · TVD 0.0088 is below the 0.05 acceptance threshold."},"verificationMethods":["statistical_counts","research_paper"],"visualization":{"operations":[{"label":"H×5","qubits":[0,1,2,3,4],"tone":"accent"},{"label":"Cost","qubits":[0,1],"tone":"warn"},{"label":"Mixer","qubits":[0,1,2,3,4],"tone":"ok"}],"outcomes":[{"label":"Best cut family","probability":0.72},{"label":"Other bitstrings","probability":0.28}],"wires":["q[0]","q[1]","q[2]","q[3]","q[4]"]}}

